# Overlay ports are verbatim copies of upstream vcpkg ports (see README.md), so
# their bytes must survive the repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` normalization
# unchanged. Thirteen files in the qtbase port are CRLF upstream; normalizing
# them would make `diff -r` against the vcpkg checkout report whole-file
# differences instead of the two lines we actually changed, and would rewrite
# the line endings of patch context and of the Windows `.bat` wrappers.
#
# This matches every file under a port directory, but not README.md or this
# file, which are ours and stay LF.
*/** -text
